# T15-E-M8 [边界清单 #29] 深递归：命中 KNOWN_LIMITS §二十三 递归深度上限（文档化限制）
# doc: docs/KNOWN_LIMITS.md §二十三
# expect-class: LIMIT
# expect-out: RecursionError: maximum recursion depth exceeded
# expect-exit: nonzero
# expect-llm: false
func rec(int n) -> int:
    if n <= 0:
        return 0
    return rec(n - 1)
int r = rec(2000)
print("r=" + (str)r)
print("DONE")
